WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.060
The next visitor to your site might

00:02.060 --> 00:03.380
not be a person.

00:03.380 --> 00:05.980
Today, an agent shows up and tries

00:05.980 --> 00:07.500
to click, type,

00:07.500 --> 00:08.660
and guess.

00:08.660 --> 00:12.140
With WebMCP, the page itself describes what

00:12.140 --> 00:12.680
it can do,

00:12.680 --> 00:15.540
and the agent interacts with capabilities instead

00:15.540 --> 00:16.860
of operating pixels.

00:16.860 --> 00:19.120
An existing form becomes a tool.

00:19.120 --> 00:20.320
And

00:20.500 --> 00:22.220
security stays with the site,

00:22.220 --> 00:23.560
not the model.

00:23.560 --> 00:24.800
Before you study,

00:24.800 --> 00:26.540
run the free diagnostic on your site.

00:26.540 --> 00:27.600
Projects

00:27.600 --> 00:29.600
and courses are free at inema dot

00:29.600 --> 00:30.200
club.
